---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../../../components/PageHeader.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Together CE" description="Together Christian Education class at The Crossing.">
  <PageHeader
    title="Together CE"
    eyebrow="Christian Education • Sept 29 – Nov 24, 2024"
    subtitle="Point all your relationships toward Christ — a six-session RightNow Media study by Sadie & Christian Huff."
    breadcrumbs={[
      { label: 'Resources', href: '/resources' },
      { label: 'Christian Education', href: '/resources/ce' },
      { label: 'Together CE' },
    ]}
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
    <div class="border-l-2 border-accent pl-6 space-y-4">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent-hover">Class Overview</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900">Point All Your Relationships Toward Christ</h2>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-700">
        We are wired for relationships. But relationships are anything but easy to maintain—even close friendships can fall apart. In a world where people quickly write each other off, where isolation has become the norm, and marriages dissolve overnight, what is God’s hope for our relationships?
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-700">
        In this six-session series, Sadie and Christian Huff dig into God’s Word to show us how to live holy and healthy lives together—with God, with our close circle, and in our community.
      </p>
      <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="https://app.rightnowmedia.org/en/content/details/808837"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="rounded-xl bg-accent px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-obsidian hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors"
        >
          Watch on RightNow Media &nearr;
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/146-Julj75gi5NERdyC7QB-Vur6PCdSMn?usp=drive_link"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="rounded-xl border border-stone-300 bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-stone-800 hover:bg-stone-100 transition-colors"
        >
          In-Class Handouts &nearr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-stone-300 pt-8 space-y-3">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-accent-hover">Friendship Workshops</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-700">
        <li>
          <strong>Part 1:</strong>{' '}
          <a href="https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1WV_3VZs8jV23lh3TngYyUwCzTyA-t5riSBsWdiwSq9s/edit#slide=id.p" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-semibold text-accent-hover underline">
            How to build deep and meaningful friendships &nearr;
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Part 2:</strong>{' '}
          <a href="https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1Hp_T8kVBGFeFUMTMTy5qLDKirhogzZoU0EZCcsiIpaA/edit#slide=id.gc6f73a04f_0_0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-semibold text-accent-hover underline">
            Basics and Applications of Active Listening &nearr;
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
